Description Confirming the dialog for a download writes the bank's numbers onto
\ the account it was confirmed for, and the book is saved.
Details The rule itself is in ImportOfx -- what is blank is filled in, what
\ disagrees is left alone and noted. What is said here is that it
\ happens at the moment the dialog is answered, and that it reaches
\ the book rather than only the copy in memory.
\
\ Both halves matter. Answering the dialog is the only moment at which
\ a person has told the program that this file and this account belong
\ together; nothing later in the import asks again. And an answer kept
\ only in memory would have to be given again after the program was
\ next closed, which is the thing the account was being taught in
\ order to avoid.
\
\ It is one write, of the chart, before any row of the file has been
\ read. The rows are a separate matter and are written when the
\ import is accepted, which may be a long time later or never.

Scenario Confirming a download for an account teaches it the bank's numbers
Description The account was imported from Quicken and knows no numbers. One
\ confirmation is the last time it has to be asked.
