BusinessRule When the name of a file fits an account
Description Whether one account is what a file name is talking about. Asked of
\ every candidate; the answer is only used when exactly one says yes.
Details The extension is dropped, and what is left is cut into words at every
\ run of characters that is not a letter or a digit, and between a
\ letter and a digit, so Visa4455 is two words and 2026-02 is two more.
\
\ A word, or a run of words next to each other, that reads the same as
\ the account's name once case and the spaces in the name are ignored,
\ fits. So does a word of four digits or more that the account's number
\ ends with. Three digits or fewer never fit anything: they are months,
\ days and sequence numbers, and matching an account number on them
\ would put a statement in the wrong account for a living.
Examples: FileNameMatch
| FileName                  | AccountName      | AccountNumber    | Fits  |
| Checking-2026-02.csv      | Checking         | none             | true  |
| checking_feb.csv          | Checking         | none             | true  |
| Visa4455.qfx              | Visa             | none             | true  |
| Opening~Balances~2026.csv | Opening~Balances | none             | true  |
| OpeningBalances.csv       | Opening~Balances | none             | true  |
| stmt_1234567890.csv       | Checking         | 1234567890       | true  |
| chase_4455.csv            | Visa             | 4000123412344455 | true  |
| chase_455.csv             | Visa             | 4000123412344455 | false |
| CheckingAccount.csv       | Checking         | none             | false |
| savings-feb.csv           | Checking         | none             | false |
| download.csv              | Checking         | 1234567890       | false |
# CheckingAccount is one word and that word is not Checking. A bank that names
# its files that way is handled by the number in them, or by the account being
# changed in the dialog once.

Attributes FileNameMatch
| Attribute     | Type    | Default |
| FileName      | Text    |         |
| AccountName   | Text    |         |
| AccountNumber | Text    | none    |
| Fits          | Boolean | false   |

