Scenario A CSV states no numbers, so the dialog shows none
Description A CSV says nothing about the bank or the account, so there is
\ nothing to show and the dialog does not pretend otherwise. The
\ name of the file is all it had to go on, and the Source line is
\ what says so.
Given the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts
