Scenario Confirming makes that account's register the active tab, with the review beneath it
Description Which is the arrangement every other import scenario here starts
\ from -- the register of the account being imported into is the
\ active tab, and the rows waiting to be reviewed are in the panel
\ below it, against the lines they are about to join. Confirming the
\ dialog is now the one way to reach it. The account the dialog
\ settled is also what fills the Account column of every row.
