Scenario Add payee rule on an uncategorised line has no category to offer
Description Nothing has been chosen yet, so the rule comes up with its category
\ empty and the dialog is where it gets asked for. The name part is
\ still worth offering: it is the half the program can work out.
Given the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts
