Scenario The menu on an account in the tree offers what can be done to it
Description Delete is offered and refused rather than left off, because an
\ account that cannot be deleted raises a question -- why not -- and
\ a greyed item with the reason to hand answers it. Checking has
\ entries, and an account with entries is not deleted; see Accounts.
Given the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts
